                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The readout in Spanish while a take records on a track that has its own length (8 bars) and start (1\/8), against defaults of 4 bars and Loop top. The strip says what this track's next take will use, so it names the track's own values ('8 compases \u00b7 Entrada 1\/8'); the defaults are what the panel's buttons edit (06). The strip does not lock or dim while recording: it only reports, and the locks are drawn on the panel. The Spanish facts are the longest the strip carries and still fit beside 'Pistas \u00b7 Banco A' at 640 logical."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
